Package: gofBridge
Type: Package
Title: Goodness-of-Fit Tests for Homogeneous Gamma and Wiener Degradation Processes
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "TITO A. Rytrace", email = "rytracetito5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Goodness-of-fit tests for the homogeneous gamma process and the
    homogeneous Wiener process observed at regular or irregular inspection
    times. For irregular inspections, the path is reconstructed on a regular
    grid by a gamma bridge or a Brownian bridge, with the bridge parameter
    estimated under the null hypothesis, following either the method of
    Grall-Maes (2012) <doi:10.1177/1748006X12462522> (regular grid of step
    t_N / N) or the Ext Bridge method (fine grid containing all observations).
    Tests for the gamma law (Henze-Meintanis-Ebner, Villasenor-Gonzalez-Estrada,
    Kolmogorov-Smirnov, Betsch-Ebner) or for the normal law (Shapiro-Wilk,
    Lilliefors, Jarque-Bera, Anderson-Darling, Cramer-von Mises,
    D'Agostino-Pearson) are then applied to the increments.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats, gofgamma, goft, nortest, tseries, fBasics, statmod
